If you are seeing this video, you are 
currently experiencing a Spore storm.

4
00:00:19.199 --> 00:00:23.000
This is a newly occurring weather phenomenon.

6
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.759
Heavy clouds are approaching your location 
carrying billions of mycopsychosis spores.

7
00:00:30.759 --> 00:00:37.000
They travel through the air.
A single spore is enough to infect a host

8
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.199
Make sure you stay inside. Lock your doors and windows. 
And don't exit under any circumstances.

9
00:00:45.199 --> 00:00:52.440
