Try not to succumb to fear and wait patiently.

NOTE 10 [Noise] 0052440 to 0053440

11
00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:57.840
How to identify the infection.

12
00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:07.880
Mycopsychosis spores can enter your bloodstream through 
your lungs, open cut or any exposed mucous membrane.

13
00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:12.280
Symptoms only take a couple of minutes to appear.

14
00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:15.360
Stages of the infection.

15
00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:19.240
Stage One. General confussion.

16
00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:30.120
The symptoms are sweating, fever, headache, vomit.
Once a host starts to develop these symptoms there is no possible cure.

NOTE 17 [Music] 0130120 to 0132320

18
00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:42.640
Once a host starts to develop these symptoms, they should immediately 
contact local Health authorities and wait for further instructions

19
00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:46.159
Stage Two. Take over.

20
00:01:46.159 --> 00:01:55.119
The symptoms are severe paranoia, visual and auditory 
hallucinations, 'uncontrollably desire to socialize'. 

21
00:01:55.119 --> 00:02:02.000
The spores had arrived to the host's brain
and they are starting to take control.

